---
import Icon from '../icons/Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<section class="hot"><div class="max sheet">
 <div class="rail"><span>Introduction</span></div>
 <div class="stmt"><p class="lab">Web developer and technical lead</p>
  <h1>I build fast, durable websites and lead the teams that keep them that way.</h1>
  <div class="stmt__foot"><p class="lede">Twelve years of building and running websites, from GoFundMe’s WordPress platform to the 100-site migration I’m leading now. Clean code, clear process, and sites that stay fast long after launch.</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn btn--solid" href="#work">View work</a><a class="btn btn--dl" href={site.resume}>Download resume <i><Icon name="download" /></i></a></div></div></div>
 <div class="strip"><div><p class="lab">Now</p><p class="val">Lead WordPress Developer<small>Elite Legal Marketing</small></p></div><div><p class="lab">Before</p><p class="val">Manager, WordPress Engineering<small>GoFundMe</small></p></div><div><p class="lab">Focus</p><p class="val">WordPress, front-end, team leadership</p></div></div>
</div></section>
